<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#childComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#childComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "child component"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#childComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#childComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#childComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifies the component whose membership is qualified by a component-membership resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
