<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#MusicalInstrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#componentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a component directly to an instrument in a discovery-oriented convenience graph."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentConfiguration> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "configuration of"@en .
