<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an instrument configuration to the musical instrument for which it is defined."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#MusicalInstrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has builder"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an instrument to an agent accepted as its builder in a reviewed convenience graph."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Convenience projection of an accepted, source-backed builder assertion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#MusicalInstrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has component"@en .
