<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an instrument or instrument state to an applicable arrangement of components, settings, and functional relationships."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasConfiguration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The domain is intentionally not global because both MusicalInstrument and InstrumentState are valid subjects. The exchange profile checks that the configuration is defined for the same instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasMembership> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
